<parameterdescription>
<para>What to take when there are no candidates at all </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>query</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The query, or <computeroutput>std::nullopt</computeroutput> to take the first candidate </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
